## Interface: 16001
## Title: LevelScout
## Notes: Leveling planner: ranks zones, orders quests, tells you when to move on. Needs QuestieDB. Data from ForeverDB.net (https://foreverdb.net), QuestieDB and CMaNGOS.
## Author: Denys Senkin
## Version: @project-version@
## Category: Quests
## Dependencies: QuestieDB
## OptionalDeps: TomTom
## SavedVariables: LevelScoutDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: LevelScoutCharDB
## AddonCompartmentFunc: LevelScout_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Map_01
